  "term": "tumor",
  "definition": "A tumor is a growth of tumor cells that can begin, progress, spread, and avoid immune attack within the body’s tumor microenvironment. In this source, tumor development is linked with chronic inflammation and immune-system changes, which can be worsened by depression and influenced by aerobic exercise.",
